Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:12.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:18.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:24.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:31.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:47.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:54.54,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:01:01.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:06.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:13.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:24.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是我们的宿敌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借由搜集四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:43.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,力量变得越来越大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.95,0:01:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他不只跟犬夜叉有仇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管任何时候 他都不会自己动手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:52.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是卑劣的利用其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:55.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了解开 弥勒法师所中的风穴咒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.23,0:01:59.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了救出珊瑚的弟弟 被奈落囚禁的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要尽快的找到奈落 打败他才行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.51,0:02:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第80话 杀生丸和被掳的小玲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到那家伙的臭味了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:56.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风的味道变得不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.98,0:03:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲被人给掳走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:23.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚奈落的分身 神乐突然出现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把小玲给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管放一百万个心吧 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:39.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你肯乖乖听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:43.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证那个叫小玲的 一定会平安的回到你的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:45.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 又是你这个大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:47.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么？这次又想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.91,0:03:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实也没有特别想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你肯帮我干掉犬夜叉 那就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:07.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就为了这么点小事 需要这么大费周章吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:17.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这个是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:24.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:27.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会为了区区一个人类小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:29.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便乖乖地听命于你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就这么放弃小玲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:44.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终究还是跟来了 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的 闻到了奈落的味道了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:19.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧 错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.07,0:05:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落这个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.47,0:05:22.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次让我抓到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:24.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非砍死他不可
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落一直神神秘秘 从没有现身过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.21,0:05:29.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么突然会出现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:50.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.86,0:05:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被那个叫神乐的女人抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.01,0:06:00.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以 你不可以出去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:48.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下你明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一出去 马上会被他们撕成碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 你也是被他们抓回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:57.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样我们一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:06:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是负责看住你的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:02.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你叫什么名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫小玲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.81,0:07:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多大啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你是妖怪的同伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:19.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢吃什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:20.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西瓜喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个人话怎么这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:30.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:33.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都不说话好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:38.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 到底会不会来救我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:48.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底有什么打算嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:56.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问你到底有什么打算
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:07:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是奈落城
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里根本就不像是一座城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:22.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落故意用臭味引诱我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我知道奈落城的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:54.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引我杀生丸进到里面去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:08:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不用一点小手段
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:09:02.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你会不会乖乖自投罗网呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.16,0:09:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要找的小姑娘 我不可能会把她藏在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座城堡到处都是瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看不需要一分钟 小姑娘就没气了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:20.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位小姑娘 我暂时把她安置在城外
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:22.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们可以不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.28,0:09:25.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你这个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是专程来救小玲的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点至少你应该明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:32.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:36.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀生丸少爷 一向都讨厌被人指挥的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:38.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是你所说的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你既不会去杀犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:42.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会特地来救小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那显然是来杀我奈落了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.07,0:09:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千方百计把我引来 还在那里说风凉话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这笔帐待会再慢慢跟你算
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还得看你有没有命活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不喜欢也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:07.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就让我陪你玩一玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:16.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:17.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:19.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我们大家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底搞什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得四魂之玉碎片就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:30.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在对面那座山上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片就在那座山上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:41.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们负责追踪四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:44.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搜奈落城的工作就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:45.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.19,0:10:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:49.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.71,0:11:03.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:06.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的臭味突然之间消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落城的结界又封闭了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.45,0:11:11.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不快点又要找不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.39,0:11:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是结界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.19,0:11:16.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.30,0:11:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤居然没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次你休想跑掉 大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一路上真是辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:12:01.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就让我奈落 好好的陪你玩个够
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:18.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是一些没用的死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.75,0:12:22.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这就是你的原形吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:24.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的原形
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:26.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 这是小意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才正要开始玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.81,0:12:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的想要我杀生丸这条命是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对奈落到底有什么好处
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:13:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧 难道奈落这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片就在这附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:11.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于被你感应到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:13.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 应该就在奈落城旁边了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:16.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想碎片应该是一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:22.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:24.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是珊瑚的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:28.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀身体里面刚好有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道真的是琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:46.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西瓜真的好甜喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:49.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要不要再吃一片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:53.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:56.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:58.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我随时都可以再去偷一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀你真的什么都不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连自己的爸妈也不记得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.97,0:14:13.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我全忘光了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:19.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道连自己的父母都会忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是完全没印象
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:25.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候 我会想起一些可怕的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:29.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事是你自己不愿意去回想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.59,0:14:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸妈妈还有我哥哥他们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全家人都被强盗杀死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:42.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到现在还常常梦到他们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得好难过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.73,0:14:47.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很吵对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.03,0:14:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都没出声 是不是觉得我很烦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:56.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经好久 没有跟人说这么多话了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别出声
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人的样子我一直都记得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:30.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来都没有忘掉过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:46.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:49.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子已经完全不记得自己做过些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经彻底毁在我的手里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:54.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今以后他什么都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他死其实对他是一种解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:05.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你在里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:06.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:44.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:47.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个下等的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:51.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要看看你有什么能耐碰我杀生丸一根指头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要仔细瞧瞧\N你这样的滥招数能玩到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:26.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掉下来的这一片片肉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.13,0:17:29.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会变成我身上的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:31.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:33.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落正在吸收杀生丸的肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:38.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它变成自己身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会突然在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然在这里消失了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.70,0:18:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说这里是奈落城
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股毒气跟瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:20.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:23.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是奈落的结界了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:42.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了 终于看到奈落城了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:51.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:55.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么人 在城外破坏我的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:18:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 马上去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.55,0:19:02.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有贵客到了 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:04.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个客人也真倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大老远专程来拜访你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.93,0:19:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果 他恐怕没机会见到你活着了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:12.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就大功告成了 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:29.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻就会被我这块肉消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:32.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候 你会变成我身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:44.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙的刀锋变成红色了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:46.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.07,0:19:49.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你破坏结界的是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:49.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还需要问吗 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.24,0:19:55.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子 你已经不够资格跟我较量了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:19:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我劝你快点滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站在那里 小心被我给砍死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:08.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:11.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你千万别跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要让你尝尝我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我跟你 得好好打一场才行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐之风一点杀气都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.51,0:20:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想不想打
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:36.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎被他看穿我毫无斗志了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来只好先在这挡一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.14,0:21:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就交给他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是一些笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.15,0:21:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:38.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸那小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我太高估他了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.35,0:21:46.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.89,0:21:51.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:53.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 你们这帮妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以现在的犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:21:59.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该可以打败奈落才对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.97,0:22:01.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要真是这样 我就可以重获自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:21.49,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:28.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.13,0:22:35.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.81,0:22:41.87,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.18,0:22:48.52,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.89,0:22:55.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.19,0:23:02.29,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:09.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.47,0:23:15.90,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.21,0:23:22.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.99,0:23:29.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.86,0:23:35.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.47,0:23:49.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次是我失算
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到犬夜叉会采取这样的攻势
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.01,0:23:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 等着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.35,0:23:54.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我非打败你不可
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想得美
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.25,0:23:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我奈落已经完全得到杀生丸身上的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.19,0:24:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为那么容易可以打败我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.79,0:24:02.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说…杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.06,0:24:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚你有多少能耐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.26,0:24:07.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你同样要成为我肉体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:10.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回的犬夜叉是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.56,0:24:12.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落大坏蛋下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:14.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 马上给我杀了小玲
